  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bancop SME Financing Partnership</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed operation contemplates a senior loan of up to 28 billion Guaran&#xED;es (&#x201C;PYG&#x201D;), which will be financed by IDB Invest. The Loan will have a term of up to five years, with a grace period of up to two years, and quarterly amortization. The use of funds will be to finance small and medium enterprises (&#x201C;SMEs&#x201D;) in the productive sector of Paraguay.</narrative>
  </description>
